        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.11.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa. 11.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ne, malaika owa sita achukha sibuumba siewe khu luuchi luboofu lwa Efurati. Luluuchi chana lwateenya, khukhwikula engila khu baami babaama ebukwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio, nabona roho bataru bamayaanu ba bafwaana nga chikhele. Bama mukhanwa mwe kuremu, mukhanwa mwe esaang'i, ne mukhanwa mwo omung'oosi owe bubeeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baba roho be bisieeno baakhola kamayia. Baroho bataru bano bacha khu baami boosi be mu sibala, khu bareera alala mwiie khu Ndaalo emboofu eya Wele Owe Bunyali Bwoosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
