                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Lukoba luboofu lwakabukhanamo bitonyi bitaru, ne chingoba che bibala choosi chonakwa. Wele akhebulila Babiloni omukali mala amunywesia endali khukhwama mu sikoombe siewe, endali eye lirima liewe lirafu. ",
